2. **Effect**: After the removal, the size of the queue should be one less than the initial size (`this.size() == \old(this.size()) - 1`).

Putting these together, the assert statement should be:
<code>assert \old(this.contains(o)) => this.size() == \old(this.size()) - 1;</code>

This ensures that if the element was present in the queue before the removal, the size of the queue decreases by one after the removal.
